  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-federico-jimenez-squash-blossom-necklace', 'Vintage Federico Jimenez Squash Blossom Necklace', 'Federico Jimenez Lone Mountain Turquoise Squash Blossom A breathtaking collector’s piece, this one-of-a-kind vintage squash blossom necklace is a masterwork by renowned Mexican silversmith Federico Jimenez. Handcrafted in 100% sterling silver, the necklace features 25 exceptional Lone Mountain turquoise stones, celebrated for their vibrant color, natural matrix, and rarity among turquoise collectors. Each stone is individually set and beautifully balanced within Jimenez’s signature bold silverwork, creating a striking statement that embodies both traditional craftsmanship and timeless Western elegance. The rich sterling silver and high-grade turquoise combine to form an heirloom-quality piece that is as powerful as it is refined. Vintage Federico Jimenez pieces of this caliber are highly sought after by collectors and turquoise enthusiasts alike. This necklace is truly one of a kind, representing the artistry, heritage, and enduring beauty of handcrafted Southwestern jewelry. An extraordinary addition to any serious turquoise collection.', 25000.00, 'statement-pieces', ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0053/8447/0592/files/D89782E5-6EE5-4D2B-A8EF-9B6CCB816093.jpg?v=1773708330','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0053/8447/0592/files/B0EF57F1-3B22-4DA4-9934-CEB6414F0E79.jpg?v=1773708381'], ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 'Title', 'My Pretty in Pink', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], TRUE, NOW(), NOW()),
